{"title":"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> be points on the hyperbola <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/a/66a5d2a94050e282571f8d2585581e14afe578d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^2}{20}- \\frac{y^2}{24} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"102\" height=\"41\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is a rhombus whose diagonals intersect at the origin. Find the greatest real number that is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/3/213cf75c75add1bff9211cd1a1c369cc8759b04f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"17\" /> for all such rhombi.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A quadrilateral is a rhombus if and only if its two diagonals bisect each other and are perpendicular to each other. The first condition is automatically satisfied because of the hyperbola's symmetry about the origin. To satisfy the second condition, we set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89fff82bb65d0215e49c8c91cb7c553da52205e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> as the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8cab3b86d4a13c3cc3680c32aaa80cc854689e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = mx$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"60\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/2/3323a5b5e7f48109880a42114831d43e9ef173cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -\\frac{1}{m}x.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"85\" height=\"38\" /> Because the hyperbola has asymptotes of slopes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/9/2993cb3a47f5ef4845cadba08de6dc8de0e81d8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pm \\frac{\\sqrt6}{\\sqrt5},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"49\" height=\"48\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/f/cffbfa2f4a80f9f2f9c47fdb9a7337e24b6f6605.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m, -\\frac{1}{m} \\in \\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt6}{\\sqrt5}, \\frac{\\sqrt6}{\\sqrt5}\\right).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"197\" height=\"55\" /> This gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/3/243efd90bdd26c40c95ad310a078dc0c434e7a41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^2 \\in \\left(\\frac{5}{6}, \\frac{6}{5}\\right).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"116\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><br />\nPlugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8cab3b86d4a13c3cc3680c32aaa80cc854689e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = mx$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"60\" height=\"11\" /> into the equation for the hyperbola yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/c/2dc42f849a9a61f2549c73663b9591711f5d18b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 = \\frac{120}{6-5m^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"112\" height=\"40\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/6/e3621d6d036286e3dca14cfb1c529b828fedf292.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2 = \\frac{120m^2}{6-5m^2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"116\" height=\"42\" /> By symmetry of the hyperbola, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/1/051a05e2e2aaf69e1c9aa10245ea286c481dd4d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{BD}{2}\\right)^2 = x^2 + y^2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"156\" height=\"48\" /> so we wish to find a lower bound for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/3/063a09c4e604080c438138ddec9dbc553f663622.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + y^2 = 120\\left(\\frac{1+m^2}{6-5m^2}\\right).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"215\" height=\"45\" /> This is equivalent to minimizing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/1/db1c642616c5d20140152569006f00520cea46c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1+m^2}{6-5m^2} = -\\frac{1}{5} + \\frac{11}{5(6-5m^2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"234\" height=\"45\" />. It's then easy to see that this expression increases with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/3/5338cfbbf4d0fec05b7092d6c3682aca5d80a954.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" /> so we plug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/6/c763d069c7b1c5ff08d9a574477c63ab5e5d5c9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^2 = \\frac{5}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"63\" height=\"38\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/f/7af20dbea162d301ac54ecc497578bbb10e8e577.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+y^2 &gt; 120,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"20\" /> giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/a/99aed00f9463b35695be845df9c019d97b615bb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD^2 &gt; \\boxed{480}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"107\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> is the asymptote of the hyperbola, in which case <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89fff82bb65d0215e49c8c91cb7c553da52205e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> is minimized. The expression of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89fff82bb65d0215e49c8c91cb7c553da52205e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/8/a2850182ef16def92aba397df07799406d2a2178.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-\\sqrt{\\frac{5}{6}}x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"91\" height=\"45\" />. Thus, we could get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc65127cc4b40f63fafd45b18ac6b542b310806e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^2}{20}-\\frac{y^2}{24}=1\\implies x^2=\\frac{720}{11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"225\" height=\"41\" />. The desired value is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/a/cca5daca7b45840c1d7255e525a7913d2bdbdc03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\cdot \\frac{11}{6}x^2=480$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"116\" height=\"38\" />. This case can't be achieved, so all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/3/213cf75c75add1bff9211cd1a1c369cc8759b04f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"17\" /> would be greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/7/a472d133f4ab89020583f7ca46f2adc11e0aaac9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{480}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~Bluesoul\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/9Fxz50ZMk1E?si=O2y5t0VXAAfPPTbv\">https://youtu.be/9Fxz50ZMk1E?si=O2y5t0VXAAfPPTbv</a>\n</p><p>~MathProblemSolvingSkills.com\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>by OmegaLearn.org <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Ex-IGnoAS48\">https://youtu.be/Ex-IGnoAS48</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/HsTmPBPd6N4\">https://youtu.be/HsTmPBPd6N4</a> \n</p><p>~Steven Chen (Professor Chen Education Palace, www.professorchenedu.com)\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I\" title=\"2024 AIME I\">2024 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2024 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2024\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018024700\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 247/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1788/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 110/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6083/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.141      1 -total\n 60.79%    8.596      1 Template:AIME_box\n 37.03%    5.237      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26507:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018024700 and revision id 237730. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}